      "content": "wait, u said \"the long-term benefits... far outweigh the short-term friction\" though? that sounds like u have a pretty strong opinion on whether this is a good idea or not. shouldn't the minister decide that based on the pros and cons? can u just stick to the facts for a sec? like, what are the specific economic theories that people on the sovereignist side use to argue against it?",
